{title: Sundari Kannal Oru Saethi}
{artist: S P Balsubramaniam Ilaiyaraaja Thalapathi}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
Sunda [G] ri Kan [C] naal Oru Sae [G] thi,        Solla [G] di In [C] naal Nalla Thaethi
Ennai [G] yae Than [C] dhaen Unakkaa [G] ga,        Jenma [G] mae Kon [C] daen Atharkaaga
[C] Naan Unnai [Am] Neenga [Em] Maattaen,        [C] Neenginaal [Am] Thoonga [G] Maattaen
[Am] Saernthathey Naam [G] Jeevanae,        [C] Vaai Mozhintha Vaarthai Yaavum
[Am] Kaatril Poanaal [C] Nyaayamaa,        [C] Paai Virithu Paavai Paartha
[B] Kaathal Inbam [C] Maayamaa,        Aaah [C] Vaal Pidithu Ninraal Kooda
[Am] Nenjil Unthan [C] Oorvalam,        [C] Poarkkalathil Saainthaal Kooda
[B] Jeevan Unnai [C] Saernthidum,        [C] Thaenilavu Naan [G] Vaazha
[C] Aen Intha Sotha [G] nai,        [C] Vaan Nilavai Nee [G] Kaelu
[C] Koorum En [G] Vaethanai,        Enai [G] thaan An [C] bae Maran [Am] thaa [G] yo
Mara [G] ppaen En [C] rae Ninaithaayo..
